<title>POLAND: JELFA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.36 vs   1.20</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.36 vs   1.65</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.30 vs   1.37</p>
<p> Sales		   10.16 vs  11.24</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.38 vs   3.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.32 vs   4.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.64 vs   4.25</p>
<p> Sales		   26.26 vs  23.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish pharmaceuticals firm is Jelfa</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
